          "id": 2236942673,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "+1, sounds good to me.\n\nSo you will need to convert/compact capsa captures before fuzzing them?\n\nThis reminds me that I added a hacky guard against mutating some parts of the Catapult wiretap module (check added for WTAP_ENCAP_CATAPULT_DCT2000 in editcap.c).  I'm sure I did it because I was only thinking in terms of fuzzing protocol data (rather than the wiretap module and handover between wiretap and catapult dissector), but I can see now that I was misguided.  And of course @guyharris later added a comment saying \"XXX - any reason not to fuzz this part?\" :)",
